# Cached market data (regenerated automatically on run)
# NOTE: DATA_DIR in backend/app.py is a path relative to the process's
# working directory. Since `python backend/app.py` is launched from the
# project root, the cache actually lands at ./market_data/, not
# backend/market_data/ -- both are listed here to be safe regardless of
# how it's launched.
market_data/
backend/market_data/